					"description": "End each new worker once its pull requests are merged or closed (at least one merged), none is open, it is idle and no message waits for it; the orchestrator gets an [auto] notice. On unless turned off.",
					"title": "project.terminateOnPrMerge",
					"type": "boolean"
				},
